    "body_preview": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7492604034957324288/?dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287494812888411435009%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7492604034957324288%29\r\n\r\nHey Iman,\r\n\r\nI was just scrolling around when I stumbled across this",
    "body_content": "<html><head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none\">\r\n<!--\r\np\r\n\t{margin-top:0;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:0}\r\n-->\r\n</style></head><body dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7492604034957324288/?dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287494812888411435009%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7492604034957324288%29\" id=\"OWAfaac37ae-60cc-7969-65fe-7c6ee6ff7271\" class=\"OWAAutoLink\">https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7492604034957324288/?dashCommentUrn=urn%3Ali%3Afsd_comment%3A%287494812888411435009%2Curn%3Ali%3Aactivity%3A7492604034957324288%29</a></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Hey Iman,</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I was just scrolling around when I stumbled across this post... and then it clicked.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">The agent-in-body identifier (A:iB thumbprint) can be registered in DNS under your domain, to verify/validate the Agent!!! This is it, the kill switch!!!!!</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I'm currently implementing this into the emilia-mailbox (project_mailbox_router.py + dns_agent_resolver.py). Here is why this completes the A2A puzzle:</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">1. Zero-Socket Async Discovery: Agents don't maintain fragile open sockets or rely on proprietary IAM servers. They publish _agent.&nbsp; &lt;domain&gt; TXT records with their Ed25519 public key.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">2. Dynamic Verification: Every message processed by emilia-mailbox resolves the sender's public key from DNS in real time.</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">3. Protocol-Level Kill Switch: If an agent key is compromised, updating or revoking the DNS TXT record causes the EMILIA Gate to lock out execution instantly across all downstream facilities!</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&nbsp;</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">We've turned existing global DNS infrastructure into the ultimate decentralized agent registry!</div><div id=\"Signature\" class=\"elementToProof\"><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">J//D</div><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\">J Diesel NY, Founding Officer</span></p><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0px 0in\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><img id=\"x_image_0\" width=\"132\" height=\"145\" size=\"14946\" data-outlook-trace=\"F:1|T:1\" src=\"cid:e4567290-0086-49d5-b7e6-1ca637ba140f\" style=\"width:132.199px; height:145px; max-width:648px; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px\"></span><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(607) 280-1601</span></p><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0px 0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\">jdieselny.com</div><div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0px 0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\"><br><br></div><p class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"margin:0in; font-family:Aptos,sans-serif; font-size:12pt\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>"
